      "filename": "Turkish - Tile with the Great Mosque of Mecca - Walters 481307 - View A.jpg",
      "title": "File:Turkish - Tile with the Great Mosque of Mecca - Walters 481307 - View A.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/Turkish_-_Tile_with_the_Great_Mosque_of_Mecca_-_Walters_481307_-_View_A.jpg",
